-- Three Kingdoms shared cast + gazetteer seed. Anchor characters and major
-- locations only, one row per work per slug (Records = historical register,
-- Romance = narrative register), so downstream content agents can reference
-- these rows without creating duplicates. Per blueprint/EXAMPLE_THREE_KINGDOMS.md
-- and db/seeds/031_three_kingdoms_structure.sql (works/chapters/groups already
-- loaded).
--
-- UUID namespace (new, unused before this seed):
--   characters   4{4|5}000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000NN  (NN = person 01-28;
--                45.. Records/Romance; Diaochan (15) is Romance-only, fictional)
--   locations    3{4|5}000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000NN  (NN = place 01-38)
--
-- Works: Records = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006
--        Romance = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007

-- ============================================================
-- 1. CHARACTERS (28 anchors, Records + Romance rows; Diaochan Romance-only)
-- ============================================================

